+## The keyboard-hint footer
+
+An always-visible `<footer data-part="footer">` renders below the list, inside the dialog. It holds exactly 3
+`[data-hint]` entries — Navigate (↑↓), Select (↵), Close (Esc) — each wrapping its shortcut in a `<kbd>`. Neither
+the footer nor its `<kbd>`s carry `tabindex` or `role`; it is decorative, never part of the navigation order. It
+adds no new prop, and it never hides — including when filtering leaves zero visible options.
